flowchart TB
    P[Click Producers] --> API[Ingestion API]
    API --> DS[Dedup Service]
    DS --> DI[(Dedup Index)]
    DS --> EL[(Immutable Event Log)]

    EL --> SA[Stream Aggregator]
    SA --> AS[(Aggregate Store)]
    SA --> LC[Late Event Corrector]

    LC --> CL[(Correction Log)]
    LC --> AS

    AS --> QA[Query API]
    CL --> QA
    QA --> DB[Dashboards and Reports]
